  "articleBody": "Plan an interior lighting upgrade by defining how each room is used, documenting the existing electrical system, selecting fixture types and controls, confirming code and permit needs, and coordinating installation with other remodeling work. The finished plan should show locations, switching, dimming, finish selections, and any ceiling or wall repairs required after wiring changes.",
